{"title":"Hello World","uid":"b9663f58f18133b35bfe243f3e916a80","slug":"coq基础-函数式编程","date":"2024-07-25T06:12:19.000Z","updated":"2024-07-25T09:53:19.421Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/coq基础-函数式编程.json","keywords":null,"cover":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"notation记法\">Notation记法</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Notation可以引入中缀语法，定义新的符号记法</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<figure class=\"highlight coq\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">Notation</span> <span class=\"string\">&quot;x || y&quot;</span> := (orb x y).</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p>中缀表达式的计算方法：</p>\r\n<p><em>(1)</em> 先计算括号内，后计算括号外；</p>\r\n<p><em>(2)</em>\r\n在无括号或同层括号内，先乘除运算，后加减运算，即乘除运算的优先级高于加减运算的优先级；</p>\r\n<p><em>(3)</em> 同一优先级运算，从左向右依次进行。</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n","feature":true,"text":"Notation记法 Notation可以引入中缀语法，定义新的符号记法 1Notation \"x || y\" := (orb x y). 中缀表达式的计算方法...","permalink":"/post/coq基础-函数式编程","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":203,"symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"study","slug":"study","count":8,"path":"api/categories/study.json"},{"name":"functional programming","slug":"study/functional-programming","count":2,"path":"api/categories/study/functional-programming.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"function programming","slug":"function-programming","count":2,"path":"api/tags/function-programming.json"},{"name":"coq","slug":"coq","count":1,"path":"api/tags/coq.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#notation%E8%AE%B0%E6%B3%95\"><span class=\"toc-text\">Notation记法</span></a></li></ol>","author":{"name":"sensuschung","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/img/avator_1.jpg","link":"/","description":"日常/笔记/日记等","socials":{"github":"","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{"tit